  "ms": "Knowledge 2, Application 2, Analysis 1\nKnowledge 1 mark for identification of a possible cause and 1 mark for its relevance to energy use\nPossible causes:\n• Increase in world population (1)\n• Increase in devices requiring electricity (1)\n• Increase in world GDP and living standards (1)\nApplication:\n2 marks for data references from Figure 1 (identifying\nthe forecast change):\n• Demand for nuclear and renewable more than double\n• Demand for gas doubles\n• Demand for coal and oil increase by between 30% and 50%\n• Comment on increase in overall demand\nAnalysis:\n• 1 mark for explanation of the link between the identified case and energy use (5)\nKnowledge 2, Application 2, Analysis 2,",
